# The human help, as a person reads it: the overview, every command, the
# topics, one topic and one command's own page. Held under 52 lines and 80
# columns by a unit test in crates/krowk/src/cli/help.rs; this build has no
# agent, so no AGENT group and no -p, --model or --resume.
@tty krowk --help
krowk help --format human
krowk help --all --format human
krowk help topics --format human
krowk help exit-codes --format human
krowk help exit-codes --json
krowk help push --format human
krowk help exit codes --format human
krowk help agents --format human
